@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 120
title Allpatek | MySQL mapping | Accounts, roles and memberships
hide methods
hide circle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
entity "users" as usr {
  {field} * id: BIGINT <<PK, AUTO>>
  --
  {field} * username: VARCHAR(160) <<UQ>>
  {field} * password: VARCHAR(120) <<BCrypt hash>>
  {field} * created_at: DATETIME(6)
  {field} * updated_at: DATETIME(6)
}
entity "roles" as role {
  {field} * id: BIGINT <<PK, AUTO>>
  --
  {field} * name: enum string <<UQ>>
}
entity "user_roles" as ur {
  {field} user_id: BIGINT <<join>>
  {field} role_id: BIGINT <<join>>
}
usr ||--o{ ur : user_id
role ||--o{ ur : role_id
entity "profiles" as prof {
  {field} * email_address: VARCHAR(160) <<UQ>>
}
usr |o..o| prof : username matches email_address
legend bottom
PK: primary key. UQ: unique. AUTO: IDENTITY. *: NOT NULL.
Solid: JPA many-to-many join mapping. Dotted: lookup by value, without a mapped FK.
roles.name uses EnumType.STRING, declared length 20.
Actual constraint names and deployed DDL require database inspection.
endlegend
@enduml
